&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/Learn-JavaScript-TypeScript-in-One-Post-Complete-Tutorial-Async-Types-Quick-Start/"&gt;Learn JavaScript + TypeScript in One Post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — React is JS; the type system is TS. This is the #1 prerequisite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://dev.to/Learn-HTML-CSS-in-One-Post-Complete-Tutorial-Semantic-Markup-Box-Model-Flexbox-Grid-Quick-Start/"&gt;Learn HTML + CSS in One Post&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — JSX is HTML; the styling is CSS. Know the box model and flex/grid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
